  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [preact](https://github.com/developit/preact) from `v8.1.0` to `v8.2.7`\n\n**Note**: This PR was created on a configured schedule (\"every weekend\" in timezone `Europe/Paris`) and will not receive updates outside those times.\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Release Notes</summary>\n\n### [`v8.2.0`](https://github.com/developit/preact/releases/8.2.0)\n\n- We're now shipping an ES Modules build and are using Babel 6! (thanks @&#8203;btd, @&#8203;matthewp, @&#8203;gpoitch)\n- `preact/debug` by @&#8203;NekR: import it and get lovely warnings, errors & devtools integration!\n- Switch back to microtasks (via `Promise#then`) for async! (#&#8203;708)\n- Fix unnecessary child reordering for certain cases (#&#8203;717 - thanks @&#8203;windyGex & @&#8203;e1ectronic)\n- Fix attributes not being removed when diffing against SSR'd DOM (#&#8203;677, @&#8203;dmail)\n- Fixed Boolean and Number component render return values rendering `<undefined>` (#&#8203;671, @&#8203;dharFr)\n- Typescript Definition Improvements (#&#8203;634, #&#8203;641, #&#8203;669, #&#8203;730, #&#8203;740)\n- Optimizations (#&#8203;672, #&#8203;696, #&#8203;697)\n\n---\n\n### [`v8.2.1`](https://github.com/developit/preact/releases/8.2.1)\n\n- Bugfix: revert `flushMounts()` change to fix incorrect timing (#&#8203;750)\n\n---\n\n### [`v8.2.2`](https://github.com/developit/preact/releases/8.2.2)\n\n8.2.2 fixes a bunch of little issues encountered by those upgrading to 8.2.1 👍\n\n- Use explicit import paths in `src` for ES Modules compatibility (#&#8203;792, thanks @&#8203;slaskis)\n- Fix CLI donation message failing if `npm` is unavailable (#&#8203;804, thanks @&#8203;andrejsm)\n- Fix Babel attempting to use Preact's configuration (#&#8203;825, thanks @&#8203;rubenmoya)\n- Fix invalid sourcemap by updating Rollup (#&#8203;800)\n- `preact/debug`: Support for attributes with no `.toString()` (#&#8203;754, thanks @&#8203;plusCubed)\n- `preact/debug`: Allow string refs when preact-compat is present (#&#8203;807)\n- `preact/debug`: Fix error when `preact-compat` was not present\n\n---\n\n### [`v8.2.3`](https://github.com/developit/preact/releases/8.2.3)\n\n- Fix missing donation message 🙈 (#&#8203;834)\n\n---\n\n### [`v8.2.4`](https://github.com/developit/preact/releases/8.2.4)\n\nThis release makes some tweaks to the newly released `preact/debug`.\n\n- Enhanced errors for `preact/debug`\n- Fixed issue where key warnings could be shown for components without keys\n\n---\n\n### [`v8.2.5`](https://github.com/developit/preact/releases/8.2.5)\n\n- A more durable fix for the Babel preset recursion issue (thanks @&#8203;rmacklin)\n\n---\n\n### [`v8.2.6`](https://github.com/developit/preact/releases/8.2.6)\n\n- [debug]: Warn when passing incorrect arguments to `render()` (#&#8203;885, thanks @&#8203;markselby9)\n- [ts]: stateful component should be assignable to `AnyComponent` (#&#8203;905, thanks @&#8203;mike-north)\n- [ts]: add link preload \"as\" to `HTMLAttributes` type definition (#&#8203;907, thanks @&#8203;niedzielski)\n- [flow]: Fix flow types and render method issue (#&#8203;868, thanks @&#8203;sgrowe)\n\n---\n\n### [`v8.2.7`](https://github.com/developit/preact/releases/8.2.7)\n\n- Fix `preact/debug` failing to load in Webpack 3 + ES Modules (#&#8203;924 #&#8203;935, thanks @&#8203;whitetrefoil)\n- Added null to paren union type of render (#&#8203;937, thanks @&#8203;nickytonline)\n\n---\n\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n\n#### v8.2.6\n-   [`6923fb0`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/6923fb03e39b43dcf0889026bdc8430134958645) Update util.js\n-   [`9df9c05`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/9df9c05574e189f356693271bf95c38bb42e734e) Update index.js\n-   [`a211321`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/a2113211b2bc00de98e89310cea5a369bd0fbd55) [ts] stateful component should be assignable to AnyComponent (#&#8203;905)\n-   [`53c87e6`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/53c87e6b82dcd23e54176a9e9da4102a05e5c0c4) Add error message about render method in debug (#&#8203;885)\n-   [`aab84f8`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/aab84f8f169298a5ee04598a7b7b0b429002bc91) 8.2.6\n#### v8.2.7\n-   [`b12dc8d`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/b12dc8db50d790a0f13a07c67a0c76de0b1e68bb) Merge branch &#x27;master&#x27; of github.com:developit/preact\n-   [`d6fa22b`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/d6fa22bb1afd9d8d7141ef7e315dfb97a4d6420c) Rename &quot;Developer Tools&quot; -&gt; &quot;Debug Mode&quot; in README (#&#8203;926)\n-   [`8b6545f`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/8b6545fb9e422e979c2d8bff7cca1070e9b4f90f) Merge branch &#x27;master&#x27; into master\n-   [`188f44a`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/188f44a9bafd24bbc0f70c057e5cac84df0431b4) fix whitespace\n-   [`18878f4`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/18878f4d73a668fb03a1e0dbc808f1f63818c46d) Merge branch &#x27;sangupta-master&#x27;\n-   [`ffe3169`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/ffe31694c5b74e1adf7d91c51e37d4139c687e7e) Added null to paren union type of render (#&#8203;937)\n-   [`85d1a71`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/85d1a7190accba0d7ade712263f9c097ef69a740) Add preact stylesheet addon (#&#8203;921)\n-   [`a95a01e`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/a95a01e335ea924eac4ab7603288be6a9560e4d3) Fix #&#8203;924 (#&#8203;935)\n-   [`9ee3031`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/9ee3031345626d7494ee54e9b14cefddc5258f68) ignore npm lockfile\n-   [`17cc8de`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/17cc8deddd3d4e592685dfa42e832f6e8d2cb795) 8.2.7\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
